                                "sense_id": "ee988f3f-70cc-3943-ba9b-e5b58d9a066d",
                                "text": "In the first place, I wish to congratulate the Premier upon the spirit which has inspired him to bring about the change from “colony” to “dominion\"; and the only defect in the spirit I can really find isthat^([sic]) he is premature to the extent of whenabout fifty years."
