                                "sense_id": "95d5fe44-bcc5-35a1-b4ff-ebb776ca005d",
                                "text": "yet the results are only approximate; and in the dates given below no painful accuracy is attempted; it being enough for our purpose to know when or whenabout any drama was produced."
